&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Coinbase Tokenized Equities give eligible non-US users a simple way to buy tokens backed 1:1 by US stocks and ETFs — no brokerage account needed. The tokens are issued out of Abu Dhabi Global Market (ADGM), a regulated financial center overseen by the FSRA, and trade 24/7 onchain.&amp;nbsp;We&#39;re hiring an Accounting Manager to be the finance lead for this product. This is a senior individual contributor role for someone who likes to build. You&#39;ll own the accounting and reporting model from the ground up — accounting policy, regulatory and legal entity reporting, controls, GL operations, and finance systems — coordinating across Tax, Treasury, FP&amp;amp;A, and controllership, as well as external auditors and regulators. If you like solving hard problems and building from scratch, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
